        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>线性代数完美总结版</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    min-height: 100%;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    background: linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      #fff68d 0,\n      #fff68d 50%,\n      #ec0b49 50%,\n      #ec0b49 100%\n    );\n    color: #222;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 490px;\n    min-height: 670px;\n    margin: 25px auto;\n    padding: 7px 58px 40px;\n    background: #fff;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.48;\n  }\n\n  .title {\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  p {\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n\n  .section-line {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 7px;\n  }\n\n  .section-number {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .indent-1 {\n    margin-left: 17px;\n  }\n\n  .indent-2 {\n    margin-left: 34px;\n  }\n\n  .red {\n    color: #bd6060;\n  }\n\n  .formula-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: 1px 0 1px 17px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .formula-label {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .cases {\n    display: inline-grid;\n    grid-template-columns: auto auto;\n    position: relative;\n    margin-left: 4px;\n    padding: 2px 0 2px 11px;\n    column-gap: 5px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n\n  .cases::before {\n    content: \"{\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    transform: translateY(-53%) scaleX(0.72);\n    transform-origin: left center;\n  }\n\n  .cases .full {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n  }\n\n  .chapter {\n    margin: 8px 0 2px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n  }\n\n  .equation {\n    margin: 2px 0 2px 36px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .large-equation {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: 2px 0 2px 18px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .matrix-cases {\n    display: inline-grid;\n    grid-template-columns: auto;\n    position: relative;\n    margin-left: 4px;\n    padding-left: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n\n  .matrix-cases::before {\n    content: \"{\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 36px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    transform: translateY(-52%) scaleX(0.72);\n    transform-origin: left center;\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n\n  mjx-container {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 520px) {\n    .page {\n      width: calc(100vw - 50px);\n      min-width: 430px;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      overflow-x: auto;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <h1 class=\"title\">线性代数完美总结版</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"section-line\">\n    <span class=\"section-number\">(2)</span>\n    <span>基本结论</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"indent-1 red\">判断向量组线性相关(命题 4、2, 命题 4、3(2), 定理 4、1及推论1, 定理 4、2)</p>\n\n  <p class=\"indent-1\">究竟：$\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_s$ 线性相关 $\\Leftrightarrow$ 其中至少有一个向量可由其余向量线性表示</p>\n\n  <div class=\"formula-row\">\n    <span class=\"formula-label\">充分：</span>\n    <span class=\"cases\">\n      <span>某一个部分向量组线性相关</span>\n      <span></span>\n      <span>向量的个数大于向量分量的个数</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"formula-row\">\n    <span class=\"formula-label\">充分：$\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_s$ 线性相关 $\\Leftarrow$</span>\n    <span class=\"cases\">\n      <span>$\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_s$ 被个数少于 $s$ 的向量组线性表示</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"indent-1 red\">判断向量组线性无关(命题 4、3(3), 命题 4、4 的推论)</p>\n\n  <div class=\"section-line\">\n    <span class=\"section-number\">2、</span>\n    <span>等价向量组</span>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"indent-1\">(1)（Ⅰ）可由（Ⅱ）线性表示, 则 $r(\\mathrm{Ⅰ})\\leq r(\\mathrm{Ⅱ})$、</p>\n  <p class=\"indent-1\">(2)（Ⅰ）与（Ⅱ）等价, 则 $r(\\mathrm{Ⅰ})=r(\\mathrm{Ⅱ})$、</p>\n\n  <div class=\"section-line\">\n    <span class=\"section-number\">3、</span>\n    <span>子空间的验证</span>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"indent-1\">(1) 非空、加法与数乘乘法的封闭；</p>\n  <p class=\"indent-1\">(2) 命题 4、1(生成子空间)一例 4、9, 例 4、35</p>\n\n  <div class=\"section-line\">\n    <span class=\"section-number\">4、</span>\n    <span>向量组的秩及极大无关组(命题 4、6, 定理 4、4 及推论 2)、（线性）子空间的基与维数</span>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"indent-1\">(1) 写成列向量作初等行变换, 确定向量组的秩与极大无关组、</p>\n  <p class=\"indent-1\">(2) 对于 $W=L(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_s)$, 则 $\\dim W=r(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_s)$，即生成子空间的维数</p>\n  <p>与基就就是向量组 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_s$ 的秩与极大无关组、</p>\n\n  <div class=\"section-line\">\n    <span class=\"section-number\">5、</span>\n    <span>坐标的概念、基变换公式与坐标变换公式</span>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"indent-1\">坐标: $\\gamma=x_1\\alpha_1+x_2\\alpha_2+\\cdots+x_n\\alpha_n$ 在基 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_n$ 下的坐标 $[x_1,x_2,\\ldots,x_n]^T$、</p>\n  <p class=\"indent-1\">基变换公式: $(\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\ldots,\\beta_n)=(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_n)S$</p>\n  <p class=\"indent-1\">坐标变换公式：</p>\n  <div class=\"equation\">\n    $(\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\ldots,\\beta_n)=(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_n)S$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"equation\">\n    $\\gamma=(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_n)X' \\Rightarrow X=SY$ 或 $Y=S^{-1}X$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"equation\">\n    $\\gamma=(\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\ldots,\\beta_n)Y$\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"chapter\">四、线性方程组（含参量、不含参量）</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"section-line\">\n    <span class=\"section-number\">1、</span>\n    <span>解的情况</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"large-equation\">\n    <span>(1)&nbsp;&nbsp;$AX=\\beta\\Rightarrow$</span>\n    <span class=\"matrix-cases\">\n      <span>$r(A)=r(\\bar A)$，无解</span>\n      <span>$r(A)=r(\\bar A)\\begin{cases} =n,\\ \\text{唯一解}\\\\ &lt;n,\\ \\text{无穷多解}\\end{cases}$</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"large-equation indent-1\">\n    <span>若 $A$ 就是方阵, 则 $AX=\\beta\\Rightarrow$</span>\n    <span class=\"matrix-cases\">\n      <span>$|A|\\neq0$，唯一解</span>\n      <span>$|A|=0\\begin{cases} r(A)=r(\\bar A),\\ \\text{无穷多解}\\\\ r(A)\\neq r(\\bar A),\\ \\text{无解}\\end{cases}$</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"indent-1\">(2) 齐次线性方程组 $AX=0$ 有非零解 $\\Leftrightarrow r(A)&lt;n$、</p>\n  <p class=\"indent-2\">若 $A$ 就是方阵, 则齐次线性方程组 $AX=0$ 有非零解 $\\Leftrightarrow |A|=0$、</p>\n\n  <div class=\"section-line\">\n    <span class=\"section-number\">2、</span>\n    <span>解的结构</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">—— 阿光爱分享 ——</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
